WEBVTT

00:05:56.917 --> 00:06:01.518
And that story also resonated
across the political spectrum.

00:06:01.542 --> 00:06:04.601
Republicans and Democrats,
conservatives and labor,

00:06:04.625 --> 00:06:08.083
they all became, broadly, neoliberal.

00:06:10.583 --> 00:06:12.167
Opposite stories

00:06:13.333 --> 00:06:16.542
with an identical narrative structure.

00:06:17.917 --> 00:06:20.893
Then, in 2008,

00:06:20.917 --> 00:06:23.226
the neoliberal story fell apart,

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:25.708
and its opponents came forward with ...

00:06:29.083 --> 00:06:30.643
nothing.